# Reviewed production deployment state for the self-serve lead funnel.
# Activation is a code-reviewed change from dormant to active; the build guard
# then requires the Actions-provided VITE_API_BASE_URL to be HTTPS and CSP-safe.
#
# TEMPORARILY REVERTED TO DORMANT (2026-08-05): the funnel was activated before
# its prod dependencies were ready — the edge (Cloudflare) CSP does not allow
# `api.traigent.ai` in connect-src, and `POST /api/v1/leads` returns 404
# (backend route not enabled). Active funnel therefore hard-failed the
# "Connect your agent" button. Dormant falls back to the working HubSpot
# capture. Re-activate ONLY after: (1) `api.traigent.ai` added to the edge CSP
# connect-src, and (2) the backend lead route is live (no 404).
VITE_FUNNEL_STATE=dormant
